Patches for building on llvm-libc that must not apply to a glibc build.
Portage does not read this directory. The image reads them from its own
/etc/portage/patches.

vkd3d-proton: add the <new> and <exception> includes that libc++ needs. The
live (9999) source here already has the first one, so on this host the patch
no longer applies and would stop the build. They were written for 3.0.1.
